    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just so tired of everything. like, every single day feels like i'm performing a role for a crowd that doesn't even speak my language. it's just so exhausting trying to pretend i'm normal just to get through the day. i don't think i'll ever actually fit in anywhere.",
