    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no quiet place. everywhere i go, i'm still in this body, still in this world, still having to deal with the noise. even when i'm alone, my brain just keeps doing the thing. i'm just so done with the effort. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise would be to just... not be here anymore. it seems like the only real peace would be total nothingness.",
